---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import profile from "../assets/profile.jpg";
---

<Layout title="Anson Chan">

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-text">

<h1>Designing Trustworthy Human–AI Decision Systems</h1>

<p class="affiliation">
  <strong>PhD Researcher</strong> · <strong>University of Cambridge</strong> · <strong>Department of Engineering</strong>
</p>

<p>
  I study how humans and increasingly capable AI systems can make trustworthy decisions together.
  My current research uses green buildings and smart cities as the real-world laboratory for designing
  trustworthy human–AI decision systems. Ultimately, I am interested in how people should think, decide, and govern
  in an age of increasingly capable AI.
</p>
<a href="/research" class="hero-button">
  Current Research →
</a>

</div>

<div class="hero-photo">
  	<img
    src={profile.src}
    alt="Portrait of Anson Chan"
    class="profile-photo"
	/>
</div>

</section>

<section class="research-vision">

<h2>Research Themes</h2>

<div class="vision-grid">

  <article class="vision-item">
    <h3>Trustworthy AI</h3>

    <p>
      Designing AI systems through evidence-grounded reasoning, multi-agent
      architectures, and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)
      .
    </p>

    <a href="/research/great">Read more →</a>
  </article>

  <article class="vision-item">
    <h3>Decision Intelligence</h3>

    <p>
      Developing data analysis tool that support complex decision-making through
      system thinking and comparative studies.
    </p>

    <a href="/research/global-pathway">Read more →</a>
  </article>

  <article class="vision-item">
    <h3>Sustainable Cities</h3>

    <p>
      Investigating how Digital Twins and BIM can support smart city developments, urban planning/renewal, and net zero pathways in buildings.
    </p>

    <a href="/research/dt-system">Read more →</a>
  </article>

  <article class="vision-item">
    <h3>Technology & Society </h3>

    <p>
      Understanding how technological innovation transforms industries,
      disrupts institutions and reshapes societies from an evolutionary economics perspective.
    </p>

    <a href="/research/disruptive-innov">Read more →</a>
  </article>

</div>
</section>

<section class="research-vision">

<h2>Musing</h2>

<p class="personal">
  Beyond my research, I write about technologies, philosophy, cities, and ideas that shape humanities.
</p>
<a href="/writing" class="hero-button">
  Writing →
</a>


</section>

</Layout>